WEBVTT

00:15:59.126 --> 00:16:01.187
through Petra, Jordan,

00:16:01.211 --> 00:16:03.696
when he got down on his knee and proposed.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.159
A year after that, we were married,

00:16:07.183 --> 00:16:09.062
and about a year and a half after that,

00:16:09.086 --> 00:16:11.306
our daughter, Petra, was born.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.742
Audience: Oh!

00:16:13.099 --> 00:16:15.640
(Applause)

00:16:15.664 --> 00:16:16.996
[What it means...]

00:16:18.846 --> 00:16:21.066
Obviously, I'm having
a fabulous life, so --

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.626
(Laughter)

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:25.122
The question is, what does
all of this mean for you?

00:16:25.146 --> 00:16:28.970
Well, as it turns out,
there is an algorithm for love.

00:16:28.994 --> 00:16:32.295
It's just not the ones
that we're being presented with online.